MID_LGV_1_M02_Kai_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Kai_m01_001: There's so many people around, but it's not easy to\nfind someone to fight with us.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Kai_m01_002: There's just no getting around the fact that I'm a kid.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Kai_m01_003: But if I can show that I'm reliable, I can make a\nname for myself little by little, right?
MID_LGA_1_M02_Kai_m01: <BLN>Not going well...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Bel_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Bel_m01_001: I have no interest in whether the Heroic Games are a\nsuccess. I merely fight in the matches they give me.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Bel_m01: <BLN>It concerns me not.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Orh_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Orh_m01_001: I feel anxious about visiting such an\nunfamiliar place.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Orh_m01_002: But I'll make the most of this opportunity. There's\nso much to experience here!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Orh_m01: <BLN>I should enjoy this!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Seo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Seo_m01_001: So this is the imperial capital. Everything about it\nis so ostentatious.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Seo_m01_002: The entire city is a monument to the authority of\nthe temples.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Seo_m01_003: Hmph...no matter. By the close of the Heroic Games,\nwe will barely notice its gaudiness.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Seo_m01: <BLN>So this is Dagsion...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Tia_m01_001: The wonderful outfits, the fashionable entertainment,\nthe tantalizing foods... Everything's fresh and new.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Tia_m01_002: There's so much to discover. And Cai is here to\nexperience it with me! It's so exciting!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Tia_m01: <BLN>It's all fresh and new.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Pet_m01_001: I'm noticing so many things I'd never see in Ribeira.\nIt's so exciting.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Pet_m01_002: Everything is interesting, but the thing I'm most\ncurious about is the food.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Pet_m01: <BLN>So excited...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Hur_m01_001: Once we've determined the additional entrants,\nmy reception job is done.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Hur_m01_002: These sacred games honor Dagda the Great, so\nI need to do my duties to the best of my abilities.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Hur_m01: <BLN>Almost done...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Max_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Max_m01_001: Heh heh HEH! Bubbly energy in the capital today.\nSeems like lotsa folks joining the games.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Max_m01_002: They must have no idea what kind of place the\ncolosseum really is.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Max_m01_003: All those fighters are gonna drown in a sea of blood.\nEhehe. Heh heh heh heh!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Max_m01: <BLN>Heh heh HEH!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gol_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gol_m01_001: The Heroic Games, huh? Well, whatever! Bet all the\nfighters'll be weaklings anyway.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gol_m01_002: I could take 'em all out no problem! Bwahaha!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Gol_m01: <BLN>Buncha weaklings!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gat_m01_001: The capital is lined up with warriors.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gat_m01_002: Though I'd wager none of them have the strength of\nthe White-Maned Demon.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Gat_m01: <BLN>All these warriors.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Dan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Dan_m01_001: Ahh! The stage is set, and the curtain is soon to open\non a drama of historic proportions.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Dan_m01_002: There are bound to be twists that even I am unable\nto anticipate!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Dan_m01_003: Exactly what I want—a chance to enjoy the games\nas a spectator and a dramatist alike!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Dan_m01: <BLN>The show has almost begun!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Die_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Die_m01_001: The Heroic Games... There will be some great\nwarriors here for sure.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Die_m01_002: Well, it doesn't matter. I'll do whatever I can to\nhelp Orchel win her wish.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Die_m01: <BLN>Much to be done.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lor_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lor_m01_001: A colosseum... There was something like that where I\nlived. Never thought I'd be in any games though.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lor_m01_002: But now, getting to see one and be a big part of\nall that? Not too shabby!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Lor_m01: <BLN>Not too shabby!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Set_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Set_m01_001: So, this is the imperial capital, Dagsion! For a\ntraveler like me there's certainly a lot to take in, but...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Set_m01_002: I get the sense even locals feel the same way as I do.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Set_m01_003: That just shows how truly alive this city is. Hmm.\nThere may be a lot to be gained from all this.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Set_m01: <BLN>Dagsion...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Nin_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Nin_m01_001: The spirits are stirring... What are they trying to\ntell me?
MID_LGV_1_M02_Nin_m01_002: Something is ahead... Something far... Oh. You\nmean a great disaster is approaching.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Nin_m01: <BLN>The spirits...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Bon_m01_001: The Dagdan Empire is a suzerain state that rules\nover the rest of the continent. And we are its guests.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Bon_m01_002: We must take care not to cause any diplomatic\nincidents or invite scorn.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Bon_m01_003: I ought to remind the soldiers once again to\nmaintain the utmost decorum while here.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Bon_m01: <BLN>We must be very careful.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Tob_m01_001: Y'know, the voyage from Saramis to the imperial\ncapital was pretty neat.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Tob_m01_002: Like that huge floodgate at Fort Hecatoncheires.\nIt sure was something to see in action!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Tob_m01_003: Felt good to sail on the Trafalgar again. It'd been too\nlong since I got to board our flagship!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Tob_m01: <BLN>It was a boatload of fun!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lil_m01_001: I bet there's plenty of work to be had in the capital.\nIt's the biggest city in Dagda, after all.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lil_m01_002: Probably could be anything from a water carrier all\nthe way up to a bodyguard for the rich folks.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lil_m01_003: If I can find the time for a few side gigs in between\nsoldiering, I could stand to rake in the cash.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Lil_m01: <BLN>There's money to be made here.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lys_m01_001: Her Majesty's howdah attracts a lot of attention.\nIt makes me proud to be a Saraminian.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lys_m01_002: Its splendor is a mark both of her power and her\nrespect for the temples.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Lys_m01: <BLN>It's a sight to behold.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Guj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Guj_m01_001: This whole Heroic Games thing... I don't have a\nboon I want granted by the Divine Sovereign.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Guj_m01_002: Better to offer my services to someone who really\nneeds someone like me.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Guj_m01_003: Yes...a new Guzran legend is soon to begin.\nI'm sure of it!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Guj_m01: <BLN>Heroic Games, huh?
MID_LGV_1_M02_Yan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Yan_m01_001: Long have I wandered...but it may be good to rest\nmy feet for a time.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Yan_m01_002: I shall sojourn in the capital awhile. I have a feeling\nthat good friendships will abound here.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Yan_m01: <BLN>I will stay here for now.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Iio_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Iio_m01_001: The Heroic Games haven't started, but the capital is\nalready brimming with excitement.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Iio_m01_002: So, the winner will have a boon granted? I have no\npersonal interest in that.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Iio_m01_003: What I am seeking is a lord to follow—the ideal lord\nand nothing less. I'll find that on my own.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Iio_m01: <BLN>Such excitement...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Pep_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Pep_m01_001: The Heroic Games will soon commence! Our heart\nswells as we think of the prospects ahead!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Pep_m01_002: We will bear witness to it with our eyes! We will let\nits stories be etched upon our heart!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Pep_m01: <BLN>Our heart swells!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Noc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Noc_m01_001: These city folk are amazing. So many people! Yet\nthey dodge nimbly out of each other's way!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Noc_m01_002: I've tried to do it too. But my instincts take over! So I\ntry to dodge, but strike a fighting pose instead!
MID_LGA_1_M02_Noc_m01: <BLN>All these city folk!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Sop_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Sop_m01_001: I'm so busy helping out with the games that I work\nup a real appetite.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Sop_m01_002: Many others working for the temples are taking on\nso much work though. I just have to carry on!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Sop_m01_003: But I do hope that the temples will at least hand out\nsome lunches once we've gotten a lot done today.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Sop_m01: <BLN>I'm starving!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Cat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Cat_m01_001: You see before you a knight of sterling talent. I'm\nhoping to find the perfect lord to serve.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Cat_m01_002: I've been on this quest of mine for some years. I hope\nto find one amid the crowds coming for the games!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Cat_m01_003: Someone here will be fit to be my lord. I'm afraid\nthat they'll have to meet my very high standard.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Cat_m01: <BLN>Where will I find what I seek?
MID_LGV_1_M02_Ned_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Ned_m01_001: I'm fortunate to be able to attend an event as grand\nas the Heroic Games in my lifetime.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Ned_m01_002: Our lives are short, compared to those of the gods,\nso I intend to enjoy the games to the fullest.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Ned_m01: <BLN>I'll enjoy every moment!
MID_LGV_1_M02_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Cen_m01_001: Preparations for the Heroic Games are certainly\nproceeding smoothly.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Cen_m01_002: From what I gather from the other priests, Ultand is\ndischarging her reception duties without a hitch.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Cen_m01_003: But she does lean toward carelessness at times.\nI'll have to look in on her once in a while.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Cen_m01: <BLN>Smooth progress...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gab_m01_001: There are folks from all over the place in Dagsion\nright now, here as state guests.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gab_m01_002: I'm gonna be busting my hump to meet all the\nbigwigs, shake all the hands...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Gab_m01_003: I'd like to make some inroads in Brezarant, but with\nhow things are there, I'm not sure they'll show up.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Gab_m01: <BLN>Kinda unlikely.
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lin_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lin_m01_001: ...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lin_m01_002: Eyes open or closed, all that unfolds before me\nis darkness...
MID_LGV_1_M02_Lin_m01_003: What's this? Who are you? Leave me be.
MID_LGA_1_M02_Lin_m01: <BLN>...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B01_m01_001: The capital's so crammed with people and buildings\nthat it makes my head spin.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B01_m01_002: I came from the countryside to see the Heroic\nGames, but I'm worn out before they've started.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B01_m01: <BLN>My head's spinning...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B02_m01_001: My mission is to keep the peace, but standing guard\nevery single day isn't light duty.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B02_m01_002: I'm grateful for all the vulkans coming here to help\nwith the games.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B02_m01: <BLN>My mission isn't an easy one.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B03_m01_001: I'm excited to find out what the battles at the Heroic\nGames will look like.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B03_m01_002: Ever since I heard powerful fighters were gathering\nfrom across Dagda, I've been beside myself!
MID_LGV_1_M02_B03_m01_003: Mark my words, these bouts will go down in the\nhistory of the colosseum!
MID_LGA_1_M02_B03_m01: <BLN>I can't wait for them to get started.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B04_m01_001: My connections as a mercenary got me an in with\nthe Heroic Games. I've been dreaming of this...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B04_m01_002: As a games participant, my name will ring out\nacross the capital. Heheheh.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B04_m01: <BLN>Hard to believe the day's come.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B05_m01_001: Just as I thought, things are picking up around\nthe arena.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B05_m01_002: If it holds, I'll do no end of business with all the\nspectators flocking in for match days.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B05_m01_003: Maybe I should brew up some fruit wine for them\nto enjoy while they watch the fights.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B05_m01: <BLN>A perfect opportunity...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B06_m01_001: It's nice of them to host such a grand celebration,\nbut I could do without the teeming crowds.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B06_m01_002: The Heroic Games are a sacred undertaking. These\noutsiders have it confused for a big party.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B06_m01_003: Faith requires steady worship and active practice!\nI just don't know about the youth today...
MID_LGA_1_M02_B06_m01: <BLN>How lamentable...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B07_m01_001: Ah, dear. Everything has been so tense during the\nHeroic Games preparations.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B07_m01_002: All of the gods of Dagda will be in attendance.\nThe pressure is high to carry it off without a hitch.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B07_m01_003: I'd better make a final check of everything we're\nmeant to have laid out. First, wood for the brazier...
MID_LGA_1_M02_B07_m01: <BLN>Busy, busy, busy...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B08_m01_001: All the priests look so busy right now.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B08_m01_002: My grandkid's going to be a soldier, so I hoped to\nget some prayers in at Mars's temple.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B08_m01_003: Maybe they'll at least let me make an offering of\nthe fruit and cheese I brought along...
MID_LGA_1_M02_B08_m01: <BLN>I came here to worship, but...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B09_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B09_m01_001: Even for locals used to the hustle and bustle, things\nhave been especially lively for the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B09_m01_002: I was born and raised here in Dagsion, and I've never\nseen such a massive celebration.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B09_m01: <BLN>This is big, even for here.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B10_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B10_m01_001: Ever since the games were announced, ruffians from\nall over Dagda have swarmed into the capital.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B10_m01_002: Some of them came to participate, of course, but a\nlot of them are here to prey on the tourists.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B10_m01_003: Though I guess Dagsion has always had a thieving\nproblem in lowtown.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B10_m01: <BLN>Watch your wallet.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B11_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B11_m01_001: I was hoping there'd be some folks from Brezarant\nin the games.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B11_m01_002: They're all really strong over there, so I thought for\nsure they'd sign up, just like Saramis did.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B11_m01_003: I grew up on stories of the champion Breza. Now\nwhat do I have to look forward to?
MID_LGA_1_M02_B11_m01: <BLN>Boooring.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B12_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B12_m01_001: The shoes I make in my workshop have been\nselling well lately.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B12_m01_002: I'm hearing plenty of, "I need a new pair after\nwearing mine out on the trip to the capital."
MID_LGV_1_M02_B12_m01_003: Thank goodness for the Heroic Games! I'd better get\nstarted making more.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B12_m01: <BLN>Ah, happy days.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B13_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B13_m01_001: Ughhh. The whole world's living it up at the games.\nEveryone but me, that is.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B13_m01_002: I just haul luggage at the port, but it takes all\ndamn day.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B13_m01: <BLN>I'm buried under work...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B14_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B14_m01_001: When you smoke meat day in and day out, your\nwhole body ends up reeking of smoke.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B14_m01_002: But you can't slack off, because you have to get the\nwhole shipment of fish smoked before it rots.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B14_m01_003: We just got in a big catch, and the customers are\nwaiting, so I've been going nonstop. It's exhausting.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B14_m01: <BLN>I'm so tired of this...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B15_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B15_m01_001: I'd love to catch a few bouts, but we're shipping out\ncome Maresh.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B15_m01_002: Not much I can do about it. There are folks out there\nwaiting for our cargo.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B15_m01_003: Guess we'll have the priest at Aurora's temple pray\nfor our safety at sea and head out.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B15_m01: <BLN>The Heroic Games, huh?
MID_LGV_1_M02_B16_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B16_m01_001: Where do those ships at the port come from?
MID_LGV_1_M02_B16_m01_002: Was it the islands of the spirits, way across the sea?\nOr some other magical place?
MID_LGV_1_M02_B16_m01_003: I love imagining what those far-off places might\nbe like. I wanna travel to them someday...
MID_LGA_1_M02_B16_m01: <BLN>So many boats!
MID_LGV_1_M02_B17_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B17_m01_001: Ahaha! We're lucky to have a villa in the capital\nso we can attend the Heroic Games every day.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B17_m01_002: I'm overjoyed that I'll get a good seat for some\nintense matches between fighters in their prime.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B17_m01: <BLN>Aren't I lucky?
MID_LGV_1_M02_B18_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B18_m01_001: Even when the guesthouses aren't in use, we're\ndiligent about maintaining the facilities.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B18_m01_002: We priests like to be able to welcome state visitors\nto their abodes with confidence.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B18_m01_003: We take pride in our guests not seeing a speck of\ndust from the entrance to the attic.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B18_m01: <BLN>There's much to prepare for.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B19_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B19_m01_001: The Heroic Games are a once-in-a-lifetime event.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B19_m01_002: If only I was younger, I'd be testing my own mettle\nout there.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B19_m01_003: I was a temple knight, back in the day. But now it's\nbetter that I watch from the safety of the stands.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B19_m01: <BLN>Ah, if only...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B20_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B20_m01_001: Not a single one of Aurora's faithful have ever\nseen her.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B20_m01_002: Is it possible that Aurora...simply isn't there?
MID_LGA_1_M02_B20_m01: <BLN>Maybe she's missing.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B21_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B21_m01_001: I hear that a monster called Cetus, the Sea Tyrant,\nruns rampant in the northern sea.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B21_m01_002: Word is that it can break a ship clean in two. I sure\nhope I never run into the thing.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B21_m01_003: Up the coast that way, cargo from the ships that\nCetus wrecks sometimes washes up on shore.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B21_m01_004: They say you can sustain yourself solely off that if\nyou're diligent about collecting it.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B21_m01: <BLN>Not something I'd like to meet.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B22_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B22_m01_001: Talk of the Heroic Games has spread throughout\nDagda, all the way to the borders.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B22_m01_002: We're seeing an awful lot of new faces, and hearing\na bunch of unfamiliar accents.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B22_m01: <BLN>Lot of strangers here in town...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B23_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B23_m01_001: I hear someone stumbled into the queen of Saramis's\nroyal procession!
MID_LGV_1_M02_B23_m01_002: Sounds like he got off light, but it's hard to believe\nanyone could be that careless.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B23_m01: <BLN>You won't believe this...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B24_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B24_m01_001: All kinds of folk have gathered in Dagsion for the\nHeroic Games.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B24_m01_002: Probably a few hoodlums in the mix too. The\nsoldiers on guard duty will have their hands full.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B24_m01: <BLN>Wouldn't want to be a guard now.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B25_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B25_m01_001: I hate to say it, but you can't make any money on a\nmatch where the White-Maned Demon fights.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B25_m01_002: The guy's just too strong. No matter how tough his\nopponent is, he doesn't lose.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B25_m01_003: Not even against the most elite, hand-picked fighters.\nThe man must've struck some unholy bargain.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B25_m01: <BLN>This payout wasn't worth the bet.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B26_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B26_m01_001: I came from the Adrestian Empire in Fódlan to buy\ncoffee wholesale.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B26_m01_002: It's a risk, since we don't have any trade relations\nwith Dagda, but the rewards make up for it.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B26_m01_003: Taking a chance on a big return is part of the fun\nof being a trader!
MID_LGA_1_M02_B26_m01: <BLN>I made some good deals.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B27_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B27_m01_001: With the Heroic Games around the corner, the whole\ncity feels sort of restless.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B27_m01_002: You can't take anything for granted in times like this.\nIt'll be a long season of keeping my guard up.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B27_m01: <BLN>Got to be on my guard...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B28_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B28_m01_001: Thieves from far and wide, outlaws with bounties on\ntheir heads, notorious mercenaries, famed warriors...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B28_m01_002: You'll find all sorts who've come here for the\nHeroic Games.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B28_m01_003: I'd love to toss them all in the dungeon at once, but\ntheir entrant privilege means I have to let them be.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B28_m01: <BLN>Best we can do is keep an eye out.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B29_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B29_m01_001: There's a virtuoso warrior in the arena who everyone\ncalls the White-Maned Demon.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B29_m01_002: He's sort of like the pride of the arena.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B29_m01_003: Then again, he's also a prisoner sentenced to\ncapital punishment...
MID_LGA_1_M02_B29_m01: <BLN>There's a demon at the arena.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B30_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B30_m01_001: Looks like some fairly well-known mercs have found\ntheir way here.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B30_m01_002: Though some of them didn't enter the games.\nThey're just hanging around doing nothing.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B30_m01_003: If you had the money to hire them, I'd say you could\nbuild yourself quite a fighting force.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B30_m01: <BLN>This bunch means business.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B31_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B31_m01_001: This is far from the first time I've wondered, but if\nwe're in the middle of a great big lake...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B31_m01_002: Why do we still pump in water from the mountains\nthrough huge aqueducts? Isn't that a bit decadent?
MID_LGA_1_M02_B31_m01: <BLN>It's impressive, but...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B32_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B32_m01_001: If you want others to take you seriously, increasing\nyour renown is a good first step.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B32_m01_002: Who wants to work with someone they've never\nheard of?
MID_LGA_1_M02_B32_m01: <BLN>Let me give you some advice.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B33_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B33_m01_001: If you go through the big gate by the arena and take\nthe stairs, you'll be right there at Temple Row.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B33_m01_002: That's where you'll find the entrances to each of\nthe divine temples.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B33_m01: <BLN>You can't miss it.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B34_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B34_m01_001: Northern Dagda, where we are now, is ruled over\nby a vast state called the Dagdan Empire.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B34_m01_002: The empire was founded by the august Divine\nEmperor, and has stood for over 14 hundred years.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B34_m01_003: There are a few other states, but most of them are\nmere vassals of the empire.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B34_m01: <BLN>This is a great and storied nation.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B35_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B35_m01_001: This aqueduct draws water from the Midea\nMountain Range northwest of Dagsion.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B35_m01_002: It's pure water made from the snowmelt. Very clear\nand crisp on the tongue.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B35_m01: <BLN>So clean, so pure...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B36_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B36_m01_001: Have you noticed the grand building sitting at the\nvery top of the hill?
MID_LGV_1_M02_B36_m01_002: That's Dagda's temple. It's the central pillar of\nDagsion, where the Divine Sovereign reigns from.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B36_m01: <BLN>Look to the peak.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B37_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B37_m01_001: Clear off. Unless you have a death wish.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B37_m01: <BLN>...
MID_LGV_1_M02_B38_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M02_B38_m01_001: This temple has been closed for hundreds of years,\never since Yu Phas's death. It's off limits to all.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B38_m01_002: Ah, it's you, Lead Priest. Do you have business\ninside? Then by all means, go on in.
MID_LGV_1_M02_B38_m01_003: I cannot allow anyone to enter without permission.\nI suggest you withdraw.
MID_LGA_1_M02_B38_m01: <BLN>This place is off limits.